@@ -0,0 +1,17 @@
+# Session Handoff
+
+## State (2026-11-15)
+All features in `feature_list.json` are `pass`. `npm run check` and `npm run build` succeed; the app launches.
+
+## What changed this session
+- **Baseline compile fixes:** renderer imports pointed at `../../shared` (wrong depth); duplicate `Window` declaration in `App.tsx` removed (canonical one is `src/renderer/types.d.ts`); `File.path` (removed in Electron 32+) replaced by `window.knowledgeBase.getPathForFile` (preload `webUtils`); `sandbox: false` so the preload can require `../shared/types`.
+- **Chunking:** `IndexingService` rewritten — oversize paragraphs split, single-doc indexing updates `index-meta.json` and document `status`/`chunks`, `removeDocument` called on delete.
+- **Metadata:** `extractMetadata` in `document-service.ts`; `Document` gained `wordCount`, `lineCount`, `fileType`. Type and 10 MB validation on import.
+- **Status:** `getStatus()` returns `AppStatus` (+ `indexedDocuments`, `totalChunks`). StatusBar shows progress; header has "Index All".
+- **QA:** extractive, grounded answers with up to 3 citations; mock keyword patterns removed (answers only quote cited chunks). Confidence 0.85 / 0.30 per PRODUCT.md.
+
+## Notes / open items
+- `npm run dev` fails if `NODE_OPTIONS` contains `--openssl-legacy-provider` (an environment issue, not the project's); run with `env -u NODE_OPTIONS`.
+- UI was verified by type-check, build, launch, and a service-level script, not by clicking through the window.
+- Documents imported before this session have no word/line/type metadata (fields are optional).
+- No vitest tests exist yet.
